108 | **Closure authority** | Stage 2 independent review |
109 | **Blocking stage** | Stage 6 / broader CI-1A acceptance |
119 | **Current evidence** | Code validates both (lines 480-487 `RestoreOccurrences`). Test `Store_RejectsUnsupportedOccurrenceSchemaOnOpen` only tampers version (99). Namespace validation not independently tested. |
122 | **Rationale** | Trivial test addition. Must be completed before Stage 2 acceptance to claim complete schema refusal coverage. |
126 | **Closure authority** | Stage 2 independent review |
127 | **Blocking stage** | Stage 2 acceptance |
