14 /// S6.2 dedicated native durability-path regressions (DF-4, D4 invariant 4, Q2-F12).
16 /// The published durability contract for <see cref="LatticeCodeGraphStore"/> is:
17 /// the <see cref="LatticeTransaction.Commit"/> operation is the durability point;
18 /// crash/power-loss/abrupt-kill/multi-process durability is <b>not yet qualified</b>;
20 /// path covers failed commits; multi-process access is serialized by file locking.
